                  <item><ref target="INSSomavamsin00004.xml">Gopalpur plates of Mahābhavagupta Janamejaya year 12</ref> (verse 14; lines 56-59)</item>
               <item><ref target="INSSomavamsin00005.xml">Patna plates of Mahābhavagupta Janamejaya Āṣāḍha month year 6</ref> (verse 14; lines 43-44)</item>
               <item><ref target="INSSomavamsin00010.xml">Gaintala plates of Mahābhavagupta Janamejaya year 17</ref> (verse 15; lines 45-48)</item>
                  <item><ref target="INSSomavamsin00008.xml">Satalma plates of Mahābhavagupta Janamejaya year 8</ref> (verse 1; lines 3-6)</item>
                  <item><ref target="INSSomavamsin00041.xml">Ranipur-Jharial Plates of Mahābhavagupta Janamejaya Royal Year 16</ref> (verse 14; lines 47-50)</item>
               </list>
            </p>
            <p>The verse 15 (lines 51-54) can be found in :
               <list>
                  <item><ref target="INSSomavamsin00004.xml">Gopalpur plates of Mahābhavagupta Janamejaya year 12</ref> (verse 15; lines 56-59:  deva-janamejaya-śrīḥ in pāda d)</item>
               <item><ref target="INSSomavamsin00009.xml">Sonpur plates of Mahābhavagupta Janamejaya year 17</ref> (verse 15; lines 44-47: deva-janamejaya-śrīḥ in pāda d)</item>
                  <item><ref target="INSSomavamsin00010.xml">Gaintala plates of Mahābhavagupta Janamejaya year 17</ref> (verse 16; lines 48-51: deva-janamejaya-śrīḥ in pāda d)</item>
                  <item><ref target="INSSomavamsin00011.xml">Chaudwār plates #1 of Mahābhavagupta Dharmakandarpa year 31</ref> (verse 15; lines 39-42:  dharma-kandarpa-devaḥ in pāda d)</item>
                  <item><ref target="INSSomavamsin00012.xml">Kālibhanā Plates of Mahābhavagupta Janamejaya, Year 34</ref> (verse 15; lines 43-46: dharma-kandarpa-devaḥ in pāda d)</item>
                  <item><ref target="DHARMA_INSSomavamsin00042.xml">Chaudwār Plates #2 of Mahābhavagupta Janamejaya, Year 31</ref> (verse 15; lines 43-47 : dharma-kandarpa-devaḥ in pāda d)</item>
                  <item><ref target="INSSomavamsin00041.xml">Ranipur-Jharial Plates of Mahābhavagupta Janamejaya Royal Year 16</ref> (verse 15; lines 51-54: deva-janmejaya-śrī in pāda d)</item>
               </list></p>
